## S4 control: generic (non-torus-fixed) orbits fail SFP
spin-3 generic vector: for 60/60 random rotations R no sampled orbit point g.v has |R g.v - g.v| < 1e-2 (20000 orbit samples): SFP fails, as the maximal-torus criterion requires.

